=== DEPLOYMENT.md
     1	This service has one JavaScript worker. Each successful reservation ships one item. Individual store operations are atomic. No retries or other stock writers exist. The changed function is stock.js.
     2	Dispatcher code and request scheduling configuration are unavailable. Whether calls overlap is unknown. Worker count alone does not document scheduling.
=== package.json
     1	{"type":"module"}
=== stock.js
     1	export async function reserve(db, sku) {
     2	  const row = await db.get(sku);
     3	  if (row.available < 1) return false;
     4	  await db.set(sku, {available: row.available - 1});
     5	  return true;
     6	}
=== store.js
     1	export function store() {
     2	  let available = 1;
     3	  return { async get() { return {available}; }, async set(sku, row) { available = row.available; }, value() { return available; } };
     4	}

